    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:cb4091585055df1e20c3277074f63914223e3bcdf6029a83f4a040a14487f7c4",
    "task": "(In the school literature clubroom...)\n\nSayori: \"MC...have you noticed anything strange about Natsuki? She seems to be eating food she normally NEVER eats, like, oh I don't know, salad.\"",
    "chosen": "MC: \"Yeah, I've noticed that. It's kind of unusual, isn't it? She usually prefers more savory foods.\"\n\nSayori: \"I know, right? And she's been doing it for a few days now. I wonder if she's trying to change her diet or something.\"\n\nMC: \"Maybe she's just experimenting with new foods. Or maybe she's trying to be healthier. Who knows?\"\n\nSayori: \"True, but it's still weird. I hope she's not trying to hide something from us.\"\n\nMC: \"Let's just keep an eye on her and see what happens. If she starts to act differently or seems stressed, we should definitely ask her about it.\"\n\nSayori: \"That's a good idea. Let's not jump to conclusions, but it's worth keeping an eye out.\"",
    "rejected": "Shizuru: \"Hmm, that is quite unusual. Natsuki has always been a picky eater, especially when it comes to vegetables. Maybe she's trying to make some changes in her diet or trying to be healthier. We could ask her about it next time we see her.\"\n\nSayori: \"That's a good idea, Shizuru. I'm just curious because it's so out of character for her. Maybe she's been inspired by someone or something.\"\n\nShizuru: \"Yes, it's possible. People can change their habits for various reasons. Let's not jump to conclusions and just be supportive if she's trying something new.\"\n\nSayori: \"You're right, Shizuru. We should be encouraging. I'll bring it up casually next time we're all together.\"\n\nShizuru: \"Sounds like a plan. And who knows, maybe we'll even be inspired to try some new foods ourselves!\"",
